      "content": "the candles are all burnt down to nothing but stubs and the fog is creeping through the cracks in the library windows again. i dont think i have anything left to say to this world. it's all just so heavy and loud, and i feel like i'm just waiting for the silence to finally take me. it almost feels like the only thing that would be beautiful now is just... letting it all go.",
