      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that the silence sounds inviting when the noise of life feels so relentless and painful. The longing for peace, especially when things are this heavy, is a very real response to suffering. Please know that there are ways to find that quiet peace without having to leave. Reaching out to a crisis text line, like texting HOME to 741741, can connect you with someone who understands this profound feeling right now.",
